# Family guide - simple, no-login static page for non-technical family
# members: links and short how-tos for the household-facing apps only
# (not admin tools like Sonarr/Pi-hole/Portainer - those still need their
# own login, this page just points at them). Deliberately has no login
# of its own since it holds nothing sensitive, just links + text.
family.{$DOMAIN} {
  import security_headers
  root * /srv/family-guide
  file_server
}
